---
title: ":baguette_bread: Cheesy Garlic French Bread"
source: Recipe Box
servings: 8
prep time: 10 minutes
cook time: 5 minutes
total time: 15 minutes
tags:
  - breads
  - garlic-bread
  - cheese
  - recipe-box
  - vegetarian
---

In a #bowl{}, mix together shredded @Monterey Jack cheese{1%cup}, shredded @Muenster cheese{1%cup}, @soft margarine{1/2%cup}, grated @Parmesan cheese{1/2%cup}, @dried parsley{2%Tbsp}, @garlic powder{1/2%tsp}, and @paprika{1%tsp}.

Liberally spread cheese mixture on each half of a cut @sourdough bread loaf{1}.

Sprinkle additional @paprika{} on top.

Broil on the farthest shelf from heat until cheese has melted, about ~{5%minutes}.

Let set slightly, then slice into pieces.
